# Relationship Rules

Spec: RelationshipRules
Purpose:
  Define the rules that constrain how nodes in the engineering graph
  can relate to each other. Prevents AI from creating arbitrary
  relationships — every edge must be typed and follow the schema.

Owns: graph/relationships.sdd

NodeTypes:
  @concept.*     — abstract, reusable knowledge
  @reference.*   — trust-weighted engineering knowledge
  @skill.*       — concrete implementation guidance
  @decision.*    — human-approved project choices
  @architecture.* — structural design decisions
  @code.*        — implementation artifacts
  @test.*        — verification artifacts
  @task.*        — executable work units
  @agent.*       — execution roles
  @proof.*       — verification results
  @failure.*     — recorded failure patterns
  @document.*    — documentation artifacts

RelationshipSchema:
  TASK --USES--> SKILL
  TASK --REQUIRES--> CONCEPT
  TASK --IMPLEMENTS--> ARCHITECTURE
  TASK --VERIFIED_BY--> PROOF
  TASK --DEPENDS_ON--> TASK
  TASK --CONSUMES--> ARTIFACT
  TASK --PRODUCES--> ARTIFACT

  SKILL --BUILDS_ON--> CONCEPT
  SKILL --REFERENCES--> REFERENCE

  DECISION --BASED_ON--> EVIDENCE
  DECISION --SELECTS--> ARCHITECTURE
  DECISION --SUPERSEDES--> DECISION

  ARCHITECTURE --APPLIES_TO--> DOMAIN
  ARCHITECTURE --BASED_ON--> REFERENCE

  CONCEPT --SAME_AS--> CONCEPT
  CONCEPT --EXTENDS--> CONCEPT
  CONCEPT --DEPENDS_ON--> CONCEPT
  CONCEPT --CONFLICTS_WITH--> CONCEPT

  CODE --IMPLEMENTS--> TASK
  CODE --RELATES_TO--> CODE
  CODE --CONFLICTS_WITH--> CODE

  TASK --CAUSED_BY--> INCIDENT (reverse: INCIDENT --AFFECTS--> TASK)

RelationshipRules:
  [R1] Every relationship MUST have a typed edge, not a generic "related"
  [R2] AI MAY NOT override relationship constraints without approval
  [R3] Circular dependencies between tasks MUST be detected (GR5 in INDEX)
  [R4] Conflicting decisions MUST be flagged, not resolved by AI
  [R5] Deprecated relationships MUST be marked, not silently removed

NoSilentConflict:
  principle: AI must not silently choose between conflicting positions
  flow:
    CONFLICT → DECISION_REQUIRED → HUMAN REVIEW → DECISION

State: +
